oid.permission.INTERNET"}, {"name": "android.permission.CAMERA"}, {"name": "android.permission.USE_BIOMETRIC"}, {"name": "com.github.muelli.kabelwacht.DYNAMIC_RECEIVER_NOT_EXPORTED_PERMISSION"}]}, "whatsNew": {"en-US": "The tunnel editor now shows structured Interface and Peer sections with\ntyped fields, masked keys and one-tap key generation; the raw wg-quick\ntext stays available in a collapsed expander.\n\nNew: export a tunnel as a standard wg-quick file, protected by device\nauthentication (it contains the private key). Tip: enrolling another\ndevice freshly is usually better than copying credentials.\n\nThe listing now includes screenshots.\n"}}}}}}